{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hopzi</strong> is a colorful <strong>4-player multiplayer platform parkour game</strong> where cute aliens jump through crazy obstacle parkours, trying to outsmart each other. The goal is not just to reach the finish line, but to be the <strong>first to arrive</strong> and prove who the true Hopzi Champion is!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Multiplayer:</strong> Play with up to three friends and challenge each other in exciting races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Parkours:</strong> Jump over obstacles and complete wild tracks set in colorful low-poly worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competition &amp; Chaos:</strong> Push opponents off platforms, find hidden shortcuts, or sabotage their jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short &amp; Fast Rounds:</strong> Perfect for quick fun or long tournaments with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family-Friendly Fun:</strong> Simple controls and goofy physics make it accessible for all ages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hopzi</strong> combines quick reflexes, wacky physics, and friendly competition to deliver a game full of laughter!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934340?t=1759333147","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934340/734f0de1e5ad0bbfec4de3d1ec98ec840a335c42/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759333147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934340/54869efa56447f9ce6815ef03d670a8a3b7d2fa4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759333147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934340/54869efa56447f9ce6815ef03d670a8a3b7d2fa4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759333147","categories":[{"descr